
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Pedido em processamento - Crowns Store</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;padding:20px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#302638,#09090e 65%);
  color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center
}
.card{
  width:100%;max-width:440px;padding:38px 25px;
  background:#17151f;border:1px solid #a98743;
  border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 15px 60px #0008
}
.logo{font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;color:#e7bd63}
h1{font-size:29px;margin:25px 0 12px}
.gold{color:#e7bd63}
.clock{font-size:65px;margin:20px}
p{color:#c5c0ca;line-height:1.7}
.time{
  display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;
  border:1px solid #a98743;border-radius:12px;
  color:#e7bd63;font-weight:bold;margin:12px
}
a{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;color:#e7bd63;text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <div class="logo">CROWNS STORE</div>
  <div class="clock">⌛</div>
  <h1>Pedido <span class="gold">recebido!</span></h1>
  <p>Estamos processando seu pedido com carinho.</p>
  <div class="time">AGUARDE POR ATÉ 1 HORA</div>
  <p>Por favor, aguarde enquanto verificamos as informações do seu pedido.</p>
  <a href="https://crowns-store.onrender.com">VOLTAR À LOJA</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
